   "source": [
    "### Observation\n",
    "\n",
    "The boxplots identified unusual values in `temp` and `rain_1h`. Further investigation showed that 10 records had `temp = 0 K`, which is physically invalid, and one record had `rain_1h = 9831.3 mm`, which is an unrealistic one-hour rainfall measurement. These 11 invalid records were removed. The non-zero `snow_1h` values were retained because they fall within a plausible range."
   ]
